@layout Legal.LegalMain
@page "/legal/cookies"

<div class="lg:w-[70%] bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl shadow-amber-900/5 border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-900/30 overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pattern-bg pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="p-8 lg:p-16 relative z-10 legal-content">
        <section>
            <div class="bg-primary/10 dark:bg-primary/20 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-primary/20 mb-12">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl">cookie</span>
                    <h2 class="m-0 text-3xl">WHAT ARE COOKIES?</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg mb-0 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                    Just like the secret ingredients in our
                    dough, digital cookies are small pieces of data stored on your device. They help us remember
                    your preferences, keep your shopping cart full of treats, and understand which cookies are
                    the pride of the pack.
                </p>
            </div>
            <h2>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">shopping_cart</span>
                1. Necessary Cookies
            </h2>
            <p>
                These cookies are essential for you to browse the Tiger van Cookie website and use its features,
                such as accessing secure areas or keeping your selected cookies in your basket while you browse
                for more.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/10 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 mb-8">
                <table class="cookie-table m-0">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Cookie Name</th>
                            <th>Purpose</th>
                            <th>Duration</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="font-mono text-primary font-bold">tiger_cart_id</td>
                            <td>Remembers the cookies you've added to your cart.</td>
                            <td>Session</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="font-mono text-primary font-bold">tiger_session</td>
                            <td>Keeps you logged into your account.</td>
                            <td>30 Days</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <h2>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">insights</span>
                2. Analytics Cookies
            </h2>
            <p>
                We use these to see which cookies are our customers' favorites! It helps us understand how the
                pride interacts with our shop so we can improve the experience and bake even better batches of
                content.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-primary mb-8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">favorite</span>
                    <span class="font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">Why we use them</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0 italic">
                    Knowing that the "Triple Chocolate Tiger" is a fan-favorite helps
                    us decide which recipes to focus on next. These cookies don't identify you personally, they
                    just show us general trends.
                </p>
            </div>
            <h2>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">campaign</span>
                3. Marketing Cookies
            </h2>
            <p>
                These cookies are used to deliver advertisements that are more relevant to you and your sweet
                tooth. They also limit the number of times you see an advertisement and help measure the
                effectiveness of our advertising campaigns.
            </p>
            <p>
                We may share this information with third parties, such as social media platforms, to ensure you
                see our latest seasonal drops when you're browsing elsewhere in the digital jungle.
            </p>
            <h2>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">tune</span>
                4. How to Manage Preferences
            </h2>
            <p>
                You have the right to choose whether to accept cookies. You can manage your preferences through
                our cookie consent tool (the big orange button in the sidebar) or by adjusting your browser
                settings.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
                <div class="p-6 bg-surface-light dark:bg-white/5 border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 rounded-2xl">
                    <h4 class="font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">browser_updated</span>
                        Browser Settings
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-xs mb-0">
                        Most browsers allow you to refuse or delete cookies. Look in the
                        "Help" or "Settings" menu of your browser for instructions.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 bg-surface-light dark:bg-white/5 border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 rounded-2xl">
                    <h4 class="font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">do_not_disturb_on</span>
                        Opt-out Tools
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-xs mb-0">
                        You can visit digital advertising alliance websites to opt-out of
                        interest-based advertising across various networks.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50">End of Cookie Policy</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>